@startuml
title RF57 — All-Star · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "MoraleEngine" as MoraleEngine
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
control "SeasonEngine" as SeasonEngine
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
Scheduler -> SeasonEngine: OpenAllStar(season)
SeasonEngine -> MySQL: INSERT all_star_event VOTING
Manager -> Frontend: vota
Frontend -> API: POST /careers/{id}/all-star/votes
API -> UseCase: VoteAllStarUseCase
alt votação fechada ou voto inválido
  API --> Frontend: 422
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT votos
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Scheduler -> SeasonEngine: CloseVotingAndPlay
SeasonEngine -> MySQL: ranking por posição + votos
SeasonEngine -> MatchSimulator: simula jogo (semente, sem lesão)
MatchSimulator --> SeasonEngine: placar
SeasonEngine -> MoraleEngine: bônus aos convocados
SeasonEngine -> MySQL: rosters, desafios, winnerConference, DONE
SeasonEngine -> EventBus: AllStarFinished
EventBus -> Cassandra: notícia
Manager -> Frontend: abre resultado
Frontend -> API: GET /all-star/results
API --> Frontend: 200
@enduml
